# Apollo GraphOS credentials for the router's license. The router's JWT edge-auth
# is a licensed GraphOS feature; on startup the router fetches a license from Apollo
# Uplink using these (the free plan is sufficient) while still routing on the
# locally-composed supergraph.
#
# Setup: create a graph at https://studio.apollographql.com, generate a graph API
# key, then `cp .env.example .env` and fill these in. .env is gitignored and is
# auto-loaded by `docker compose` (i.e. `task up`).
APOLLO_KEY=
APOLLO_GRAPH_REF=
